/T (Many NoSQL systems favour the BASE model: Basically Available, Soft state, Eventually consistent. They accept that copies of data on different servers may briefly disagree in exchange for speed and availability.)
/E (Many NoSQL systems favour the BASE model: Basically Available, Soft state, Eventually consistent. They accept that copies of data on different servers may briefly disagree in exchange for speed and availability.)
/Pg 12 0 R
