/Parent 480 0 R
/Next 521 0 R
>>
endobj
521 0 obj
<<
/Title (Limitations: harder to scale horizontally, rigid schema changes, can be slower for extremely high-volume simple workloads, poor fit for unstructured data.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 480 0 R
/Prev 520 0 R
>>
endobj
522 0 obj
<<
/Title (Advantages: easy horizontal scaling, high availability, flexible schema, very fast simple reads and writes, suits big data and real-time workloads.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 481 0 R
/Next 523 0 R
>>
endobj
523 0 obj
<<
