<<
/Title (Because requirements differ across parts of one application, many organizations use polyglot persistence: several databases, each for the job it does best. Example: relational for transactions, a key-value cache for speed, a document store for profiles, and a search engine or graph database for specialized queries.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 517 0 R
/Prev 592 0 R
>>
endobj
