567 0 obj
<<
/Title (Large companies commonly combine both families. An e-commerce company, for example, keeps orders and payments in a relational database, the product catalog in a document store, and sessions and caches in Redis.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 519 0 R
/Prev 596 0 R
>>
